{{- /*
The MCP registration for the hosts that read the standard shape into a file of
their own: .mcp.json in a tree for Claude Code, .agents/mcp_config.json for
Antigravity.  One asset rather than two identical ones, so a change to how the
server is registered reaches both.  Should the two shapes ever diverge, split
this back into a file each rather than adding a knob.

The two plugin hosts read a different shape under a different key, and are in
mcp.local.json.tmpl.
*/ -}}
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "faramir": {
      "command": "{{.BinDir}}/faramir",
      "args": ["mcp"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
